@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam TitleFontStyle plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "<u>:GitHub Actions</u>" as GH

participant "<u>:Maven(Cucumber)</u>" as Maven

participant "<u>:DashboardReporter</u>" as Reporter

participant "<u>:DashboardController</u>" as Controller

participant "<u>:DashboardService</u>" as Service

database "<u>:PostgreSQL</u>" as DB

boundary "<u>:Dashboard UI</u>" as UI

== Extraction des résultats ==

activate GH

GH -> Maven: 1: Lancer les tests\n Cucumber
activate Maven
Maven -> Maven: 2: Exécuter les scénarios
Maven -> Maven: 3: Générer les rapports JSON
deactivate Maven

GH -> Reporter: 4: Transmettre le rapport JSON
activate Reporter

Reporter -> Reporter: 5: Lire et parser le JSON
Reporter -> Reporter: 6: Pour chaque scénario :\ncalculer status + durée

Reporter -> Controller: 7: POST /api/cucumber-runs\n{run_id, scenarios[]}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: 8: push_cucumber_run\n(scenarios, run_id)
activate Service

Service -> DB: 9: INSERT INTO cucumber_runs\n(feature_name, scenario,\nstatus, duration_ns, tags, run_id)
activate DB
DB --> Service: 10: rows inserted
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller: 11: {inserted, run_id}
deactivate Service
Controller --> Reporter: 12: 201 Created
deactivate Controller

Reporter -> Controller: 13: POST /api/healing-events\n(baseline_hit, score,\nlocators…)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: 14: create_healing_event\n(event_data)
activate Service

Service -> DB: 15: INSERT INTO healing_events
activate DB
DB --> Service: 16: event_id
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller: 17: {id: event_id}
deactivate Service
Controller --> Reporter: 18: 201 Created
deactivate Controller

deactivate Reporter

== Exposition dans le Dashboard ==

UI -> Controller: 19: GET /api/dashboard\n(?run_id=…)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: 20: dashboard_summary\n(run_id, actor)
activate Service

Service -> Service: 21: Résoudre le run_id\n(latest si non fourni)
Service -> Service: 22: resolve_healing_payload()\n(multi-scope)

Service -> DB: 23: SELECT FROM metrics_snapshots\n/healing_events / cucumber_runs
activate DB

DB --> Service: 24: {metrics, history,\nevents, counts}
deactivate DB

Service -> Service: 25: Filtrer selon le rôle\n(admin / pm / qa)

Service --> Controller: 26: {run_id, metrics,\ncucumber, events, …}
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 27: JSON formaté
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI: 28: Afficher KPIs,\ngraphiques et tableau
@enduml